  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "We substitute the value from the given options and solve the equation using BODMAS rule:**\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/8a6f93b0f8305d496162d41f65450f13e20c650df2dbe481929271174df469e9.png] \n\nOption 1) 14 and 2; × and +\n\n2 + 8 × __**64 ÷ 32**__ – 14 = 88\n\n2 + __**8 **____**× **2__ – 14 = 88\n\n__**2 + **____16__** – 14 = 88**\n__**18 - 14**__ = 88\n\n4 ≠ 88\n\nOption 2) 8 and 32; × and +\n\n14 + 32 × __**64 ÷ 8**__ – 2 = 88\n\n14 + __**32**____** × **8__ – 2 = 88\n\n__**14 + **____256__** – 2 = 88\n\n__**270 **____**– 2**__ = 88\n\n268 ≠ 88\n\nOption 3) 32 and 64; + and ÷\n\n14 × __**8 ÷ 32**__ + 64 – 2 = 88\n\n__**14 × **0.25__ + 64 – 2 = 88\n\n__**3.5 **____**+ 64**__ – 2 = 88\n\n__**67.5 – 2**__ = 88\n\n65.5 ≠ 88\n\nOption 4) 8 and 2; – and ÷ \n\n14 × 2 + 64 - __**32 ÷ 8**__ = 88\n\n__**14 × 2**__ + 64 - 4 = 88\n\n__**28 + 64**__ - 4 = 88\n\n__**92 - 4**__ = 88\n\n88 = 88\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 4)**",
